#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""hermes-bots — list active Hermes agent sessions or bot chat messages.

Modes:
  hermes-bots           -> active agents
  hermes-bots --chats   -> bot chat messages
  hermes-bots --peers   -> registered Hermes peers
  hermes-bots --discover -> scan LAN for Hermes peer ports
  hermes-bots --status  -> local Hermes dashboard summary

Outputs JSON:
  agents mode:
    {"active": <int>, "sessions": [...]}
  chats mode:
    {"chats": [{"id": "...", "title": "...", "lastActivityAt": <ts>, "messages": [...]}]}
  peers mode:
    {"peers": [{"name": "...", "url": "...", "keySet": <bool>}]}
"""
